1. Supports video mode for 4k video capture;
2. provide a widescreen (16:9), common (4:3), square (1:1) three photos proportional output of widescreen ultra for landscape;
3. high resolution photo output, photo detail visible, away from the residue definition;
4. fast auto-focus and auto-exposure, where the where;
5. very easy access to photo albums, supported a build to share favorite photos to the app, Facebook, QQ, Facebook, Twitter and other popular social networks;
